      "content": "idk i just dont think it's that serious... like i can still walk on it ok and it's not a crazy amount of pain. id just rather just stay home and rest till monday. if i take some extra strength ibuprofen and keep it elevated, will that like... basically do the same thing as a doctor would check for, just for the swelling? like can't i just manage it at home for a day or two?",
